Z||000000||drquazar||06-01-2000||01:42 AM||||Ok I just bought a very plain 4cyl 1988 Fiero Coupe...no extras  just basics...<BR>I read that electrical troubles were Fieros most prevalent problem....And true to form its has already started 3 days after my purchase....<BR>The first trouble i saw was that the right Blinker lite on the Dash stayed on ...(generally i sigh of bad bulb or short)...The Rear Tail lights all seem fine....but the Right front Blinker was only firing one filament...making it noticable dimmer....Switching bulbs made no difference...<BR>I let this slide since it still worked but withing 5 days of buying the Radio stopped...(The Green LED screen is blank)....OK I figure fuse.....But meantime I notice that the 2 bulbs that lite up under dash on both sides go OFF when door is open....Yet Come ON when closed...AND DONT go off at all with doors closed...keys out not running....SIGH  I pulled the 2 bulbs so that my battery would not run down.....<BR>Sooooooo at this point i check the fuses....All seemed fine but one....Said Hazard Light next to it...25amp....(My hazard lites blink as well as blinkers   just the dim front left bulb...)   So i stick a fuse in...POOF....i stick another in POOF.....I blew 3 fuses instantly...so i left it out.....<BR>So am I really screwed?...I know very little about my little Fiero except that I love it and it runs great.....YET I am terrified that the electric systems are screwed up and likely very costly to track down..... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>If any one can help I would be appreciative of ANY thing I may try....(I miss radio... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> and tape deck works but poorly) <BR>One question I have is....When the 4 way flashers are on....do the front blinkers go from side to side while flashing?  Mine does...although back lights all blink simultaneously.?  is this normal...may help me diagnose to know....<BR>desparate new owner...<BR>call me collect<BR>802 438 5097   if you can help||||reg||1
